- # 一句话总结
前期利用Journal 无压记录，后期在Contents中建立体系，保证即使删除Journal也不会影响Contents的正常使用 - # 帮助 - ## 官方帮助文档 - [官方英文文档](https://docs.logseq.com) - [第三方中文文档](http://northnight.gitee.io/logseq-documents/#/page/Contents) - ## 使用实践技巧 - alias - 页面别名 - tags - 标签 - draw - 绘图 - `draw ` - namespace - 自带的目录系统 - `{{namespace logseq}} ` - Markdown - `**加粗**` → **加粗** - `*斜体*` → *斜体* - `~~删除线~~` → ~~删除线~~ - `·代码·` -> `代码` - `---` -> 分割线 - 标题 - # 标题1 - ## 标题2 - ### 标题3 - #### 标题4 - ##### 标题5 - ###### 标题6 - ## 使用理论技巧 - [[GTD的四象限]] - [数字花园](https://garden.oldwinter.top/) - 发布技巧 - DNS管理 [Cloudflare](https://dash.cloudflare.com/) - # 主题 - [css自助修改手册](https://logseq.pro/#/page/logseq自助修改css指导手册) - [官方css主题](https://github.com/logseq/awesome-logseq) - # 备份 - ## custom.css 备份
```css /* 备注 */
/* Tags 圆形标签 */ a.tag { border: 1px solid currentColor; /*气泡边框粗细，默认1*/ background-color: var(--ct-block-reference-background); /*气泡背景色*/ padding: 0 6px; /*气泡内空隙，默认0 4*/ border-radius: 20px; /*气泡圆角大小，默认10*/ font-weight: 500; /*字体粗细，默认600*/ font-size: 10px; /*字体大小，默认10*/ vertical-align: 2.25px; /*气泡居中，默认2.25*/ }
/* Formatting the Tasks 圆形任务 .form-checkbox { border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid var(--ls-link-text-color); background-color: [[9cccff]]; } .waiting > .form-checkbox { border: 2px solid var(--highlight-color); background-color: [[fff0ce]]; } .task-status.block-marker.waiting { color: [[e0a210]]; border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; padding: 0 4px; margin-right: 4px; } .marker-switch.block-marker.DOING, .marker-switch.block-marker.TODO, .marker-switch.block-marker.LATER { color: var(--ls-link-text-color); border: 1px solid currentColor; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; padding: 0 4px; margin-right: 4px; } a.tag:hover { background-color: var(--ct-block-reference-background-hover); } */
/* 聚焦模式 */ /* 白天模式 */ .editor-inner { border: rgb(157, 187, 216); /* 线框颜色 */ border-width: 2px; /* 线框粗细 */ border-style: dotted; /* dotted 点，dashed 虚线，solid 实线，double 双线，groove 线框凸出，ridge 线框凹陷，inset 块凸出，outset 块凹陷 */ border-radius: 5px; /* 线框弧度 */ padding-left: 2px; /* 左边距 */ margin-top: -2px; /* 上边距 */ margin-left: -4px; /* 右边距 */ } /* 夜间模式 */ html[data-theme="dark"] .editor-inner { border: rgb(96, 147, 160); border-width: 2px; border-style: dotted; border-radius: 5px; padding-left: 2px; margin-top: -2px; margin-left: -4px; }
/* 更改图片大小 img { border: 1px solid rgb(96, 147, 160); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0px; width: 500px; height: auto; }
*/
``` - ## 设置备份
config.edn
```css {:meta/version 1
;; 2023-04-26 简单翻译 @阿琼
;; Currently, we support either "Markdown" or "Org". ;; This can overwrite your global preference so that ;; maybe your personal preferred format is Org but you'd ;; need to use Markdown for some projects. ;; 目前，我们支持"Markdown"或"Org"。 ;; 这可以复盖您的全局首选项，以便也许你个人喜欢的格式是Org，但对于某些特殊项目您需要使用Markdown格式。 ;; :preferred-format ""
;; Preferred workflow style. ;; Value is either ":now" for NOW/LATER style, ;; or ":todo" for TODO/DOING style. ;; 首选工作流样式。 ;; 赋值要么是":now"表示Now/Later的风格，要么是":todo"表示Todo/Doing风格。 :preferred-workflow :todo
;; The app will ignore those directories or files. ;; E.g. :hidden ["/archived" "/test.md" "/附件/archived"] ;; 该应用程序将忽略这些目录或文件。 ;; 例如 :hidden ["/archived" "/test.md" "/附件/archived"] :hidden []
;; When creating the new journal page, the app will use your template if there is one. ;; You only need to input your template name here. ;; 创建新的日记页面时，应用程序将使用您的模板（如果有）。 ;; 您只需在此处输入您的模板名称。 :default-templates {:journals "每日复盘"}
;; Whether to enable hover on tooltip preview feature ;; Default is true, you can also toggle this via setting page ;; 是否启用鼠标悬停预览功能 ;; 默认为真，您也可以通过设置页面切换 :ui/enable-tooltip? true
;; Enable Block timestamp ;; 是否启用块的时间戳 :feature/enable-block-timestamps? false
;; Enable remove accents when searching. ;; After toggle this option, please remember to rebuild your search index by press (cmd+c cmd+s). ;; 在搜索时启用删除重音。 ;; 切换此选项后，请记住按（cmd+c cmd+s）重建搜索索引。 :feature/enable-search-remove-accents? true
;; Disable Built-in Scheduled and deadline Query ;; 禁用内置的预定和截止日期查询 ;; :feature/disable-scheduled-and-deadline-query? true
;; Specify the date on which the week starts. ;; Goes from 0 to 6 (Monday to Sunday), default to 6 ;; 指定一周的开始日期。 ;; 从 0 到 6（周一到周日），默认为 6 :start-of-week 0
;; Specify a custom CSS import ;; This option take precedence over your local `logseq/custom.css` file ;; You may find a list of awesome logseq themes here: ;; https://github.com/logseq/awesome-logseq#css-themes ;; 指定自定义 CSS 导入 ;; 此选项优先于您的本地 `logseq/custom.css` 文件 ;; 您可以在这里找到很棒的 logseq 主题列表： ;; https://github.com/logseq/awesome-logseq#css-themes ;; Example: ;; :custom-css-url "@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/dracula/logseq@master/custom.css');"
;; Set Bullet indentation when exporting ;; default option: tab ;; Possible options are for `:sidebar` are ;; 1. `:eight-spaces` as eight spaces ;; 2. `:four-spaces` as four spaces ;; 3. `:two-spaces` as two spaces ;; 导出时设置项目符号缩进 ;; 默认选项：选项卡 ;; `:sidebar` 的可能选项是 ;; 1. `:eight-spaces` 为八个空格 ;; 2. `:four-spaces` 为四个空格 ;; 3. `:two-spaces` 作为两个空格 ;; :export/bullet-indentation :tab
;; When :all-pages-public? true, export repo would export all pages within that repo. ;; Regardless of whether you've set any page to public or not. ;; 什么时候所有页面都公开？是的，export repo 将导出该 repo 中的所有页面。 ;; 无论您是否将任何页面设置为公开。 ;; Example: ;; :publishing/all-pages-public? true
;; Specify default home page and sidebar status for Logseq ;; If not specified, Logseq default opens journals page on startup ;; value for `:page` is name of page ;; Possible options for `:sidebar` are ;; 1. `"Contents"` to open up `Contents` in sidebar by default ;; 2. `page name` to open up some page in sidebar ;; 3. Or multiple pages in an array ["Contents" "Page A" "Page B"] ;; If `:sidebar` is not set, sidebar will be hidden ;; 为 Logseq 指定默认主页和侧边栏状态 ;; 如果未指定，Logseq 默认在启动时打开日志页面 ;; `:page` 的值是页面名称 ;; `:sidebar` 的可选项是： ;; 1. `"Contents"`默认在侧边栏打开`Contents` ;; 2. `page name` 在侧边栏打开一些页面 ;; 3.或者数组中的多个页面[“目录”“页面A”“页面B”] ;; 如果没有设置 :sidebar ，侧边栏将被隐藏
;; Example:
;; 1. Setup page "Changelog" as home page and "Contents" in sidebar ;; 1. 将“Changelog”页面设置为主页，将“Contents”设置为侧边栏 ;; :default-home {:page "Changelog", :sidebar "Contents"}
;; 2. Setup page "Jun 3rd, 2021" as home page without sidebar ;; 2.将页面“Jun 3rd, 2021”设置为没有侧边栏的主页 ;; :default-home {:page "Jun 3rd, 2021"}
;; 3. Setup page "home" as home page with multiple pages in sidebar ;; 3. 将“home”页面设置为在侧边栏中包含多个页面的主页 ;; :default-home {:page "home" :sidebar ["page a" "page b"]}
;; Tell logseq to use a specific folder in the repo as a default location for notes ;; if not specified, notes are stored in `pages` directory ;; 告诉 logseq 使用 repo 中的特定文件夹作为注释的默认位置 ;; 如果未指定，笔记将存储在 `pages` 目录中 ;; :pages-directory "your-directory"
;; Tell logseq to use a specific folder in the repo as a default location for journals ;; if not specified, journals are stored in `journals` directory ;; 告诉 logseq 使用 repo 中的特定文件夹作为日志的默认位置 ;; 如果未指定，期刊将存储在“journals”目录中 ;; :journals-directory "your-directory"
;; Set this to true will convert ;; `[[Grant Ideas]]` to `[[file:./grant_ideas.org][Grant Ideas]]` for org-mode ;; For more, see https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/672 ;; 将此设置为 true 将转换 ;; `[[Grant Ideas]]` 到 `[[file:./grant_ideas.org][Grant Ideas]]` for org-mode ;; 有关更多信息，请参阅 https://github.com/logseq/logseq/issues/672 ;; :org-mode/insert-file-link? true
;; If you prefer to use the file name as the page title ;; instead of the first heading's title ;; the only option for now is `file` ;; 如果您更喜欢使用文件名作为页面标题，而不是第一个标题的标题。现在唯一的选择是`file` ;; :page-name-order "file"
;; Setup custom shortcuts under `:shortcuts` key ;; Syntax: ;; 1. `+` means keys pressing simultaneously. eg: `ctrl+shift+a` ;; 2. ` ` empty space between keys represents key chords. eg: `t s` means press `s` follow by `t` ;; 3. `mod` means `Ctrl` for Windows/Linux and `Command` for Mac ;; 4. use `false` to disable particular shortcut ;; 4. you can define multiple bindings for one action, eg `["ctrl+j" "down"]` ;; full list of configurable shortcuts are available below: ;; https://github.com/logseq/logseq/blob/master/src/main/frontend/modules/shortcut/config.cljs ;; Example: ;; :shortcuts ;; {:editor/new-block "enter" ;; :editor/new-line "shift+enter" ;; :editor/insert-link "mod+shift+k" ;; :editor/hightlight false ;; :ui/toggle-settings "t s" ;; :editor/up ["ctrl+k" "up"] ;; :editor/down ["ctrl+j" "down"] ;; :editor/left ["ctrl+h" "left"] ;; :editor/right ["ctrl+l" "right"]} :shortcuts {:go/search "ctrl+f", :editor/outdent "ctrl+tab", :go/electron-find-in-page "shift+f"}
;; By default, pressing `Enter` in the document mode will create a new line. ;; Set this to `true` so that it's the same behaviour as the usual outliner mode. ;; 默认情况下，在文档模式下按 `Enter` 将创建一个新行。 ;; 将其设置为“true”，以便它与通常的大纲模式具有相同的行为。 :shortcut/doc-mode-enter-for-new-block? false
;; Block content larger than `block/content-max-length` will not be searchable ;; or editable for performance. ;; 大于“block/content-max-length”的块内容将不可搜索 ;; 或可编辑性能。 :block/content-max-length 5000
;; Whether to show command doc on hover ;; 悬停时是否显示命令文档 :ui/show-command-doc? true
;; Whether to show empty bullets for non-document mode (the default mode) ;; 非文档模式是否显示空项目符号（默认模式） :ui/show-empty-bullets? false
;; Pre-defined :view function to use in Query :query/views {:pprint (fn [r] [:pre.code (pprint r)])}
;; Pre-defined :result-transform function to use in Query :query/result-transforms {:sort-by-priority (fn [result] (sort-by (fn [h] (get h :block/priority "Z")) result))}
;; The app will show those queries in today's journal page, ;; the "NOW" query asks the tasks which need to be finished "now", ;; the "NEXT" query asks the future tasks. ;; 该应用程序将在今天的期刊页面中显示这些查询， ;; “Now”查询询问需要“Now”完成的任务， ;; “NEXT”查询询问未来的任务。 :default-queries {:journals [{:title "→ [[Todolist]]｜[[行为设计|Design of life]]｜[[Contents]]" :query [:find (pull ?h [*]) :in $ ?start ?today :where [?h :block/marker ?marker] [(contains? #{"NOW" "DOING" "TODO"} ?marker)] [?h :block/page ?p] [?p :block/journal? true] [?p :block/journal-day ?d] [(>= ?d ?start)] [(<= ?d ?today)]] :inputs [:30d :today] :result-transform (fn [result] (sort-by (fn [h] (get h :block/priority "Z")) result)) :collapsed? false} {:title "📅 NEXT" :query [:find (pull ?h [*]) :in $ ?start ?next :where [?h :block/marker ?marker] [(contains? #{"NOW" "LATER" "TODO"} ?marker)] [?h :block/page ?p] [?p :block/journal? true] [?p :block/journal-day ?d] [(> ?d ?start)] [(< ?d ?next)]] :inputs [:today :7d-after] :collapsed? false}]}
;; Add your own commands to slash menu to speedup. ;; 将您自己的命令添加到斜杠菜单以加快速度。 ;; E.g. ;; :commands ;; [ ;; ["js" "Javascript"] ;; ["md" "Markdown"] ;; ] :commands []
;; By default, a block can only be collapsed if it has some children. ;; `:outliner/block-title-collapse-enabled? true` enables a block with a title ;; (multiple lines) can be collapsed too. For example: ;; - block title ;; block content ;; 默认情况下，一个块只有在它有一些孩子时才能折叠。 ;; `：outliner/block-title-collapse-enabled？ true` 启用带有标题的块 ;; （多行）也可以折叠。例如： ;; - 区块标题 ;; 块内容 :outliner/block-title-collapse-enabled? false
;; Macros replace texts and will make you more productive. ;; For example: ;; Change the :macros value below to: ;; {"poem" "Rose is $1, violet's $2. Life's ordered: Org assists you."} ;; input "{{poem red,blue}}" ;; becomes ;; Rose is red, violet's blue. Life's ordered: Org assists you. :macros {}
;; The default level to be opened for the linked references. ;; For example, if we have some example blocks like this: ;; - a [[page]] (level 1) ;; - b (level 2) ;; - c (level 3) ;; - d (level 4) ;; ;; With the default value of level 2, `b` will be collapsed. ;; If we set the level's value to 3, `b` will be opened and `c` will be collapsed. ;; 为链接引用打开的默认级别。 ;; 例如，如果我们有一些这样的示例块： ;; - a [[页面]] （1 级） ;; - b （2 级） ;; - c （3 级） ;; -d （4 级） ;; ;; 使用级别 2 的默认值，`b` 将被折叠。 ;; 如果我们将级别的值设置为 3，则 `b` 将打开，而 `c` 将折叠。 :ref/default-open-blocks-level 2
:ref/linked-references-collapsed-threshold 50 ;; 着墨引用折叠阈值
:favorites ["待办" "短句摘录" "Contents" "代办"]
;; any number between 0 and 1 (the greater it is the faster the changes of the next-interval of card reviews) (default 0.5) ;; 0 到 1 之间的任意数字（越大，下一次卡评变化越快）（默认 0.5） ;; :srs/learning-fraction 0.5
;; the initial interval after the first successful review of a card (default 4) ;; 第一次成功查看卡片后的初始间隔（默认 4） ;; :srs/initial-interval 4
;; hide specific properties for blocks ;; E.g. :block-hidden-properties #{:created-at :updated-at} ;; 隐藏块的特定属性 ;; 例如 :block-hidden-properties #{:created-at :updated-at} ;; :block-hidden-properties #{}
;; Enable all your properties to have corresponding pages ;; 使您的所有属性都有相应的页面 :property-pages/enabled? true :feature/enable-flashcards? false :feature/enable-journals? true :default-home {} :journal/page-title-format "yyyy/MM/dd" :ui/show-brackets? false :feature/enable-timetracking? false :mobile/toolbar-stats {:bold {:counts 1}, :brand-youtube {:counts 1}, :checkbox {:counts 43}, :parentheses {:counts 1}, :command {:counts 3}, :calendar {:counts 3}, :paint {:counts 4}, :list {:counts 4}, :link {:counts 6}, :strikethrough {:counts 3}, :code {:counts 6}, :camera {:counts 7}, :rotate {:counts 6}, :tag {:counts 2}, :brackets {:counts 79}, :italic {:counts 2}, :a-b {:counts 2}, :rotate-clockwise {:counts 9}} :feature/enable-whiteboards? true :graph/settings {:journal? false, :orphan-pages? true, :builtin-pages? false, :excluded-pages? true} :editor/perferred-pasting-file? false :ui/show-full-blocks? true :file/name-format :triple-lowbar :publishing/all-pages-public? true
;; Properties to exclude from having property pages ;; E.g.:property-pages/excludelist #{:duration :author} ;; 从属性页中排除的属性 ;; 例如 :property-pages/excludelist #{:duration :author} ;; :property-pages/excludelist
;; Enables property values to contain a mix of tags, page-refs, special ;; punctuation and free-form text. ;; Re-index current graph for config to take effect ;; 使属性值能够包含标签、页面引用、特殊 ;; 标点符号和自由格式文本。 ;; 重新索引当前图表以使配置生效 ;; :rich-property-values? true
;; logbook setup ;; :logbook/settings ;; {:with-second-support? false ;limit logbook to minutes, seconds will be eliminated ;; :enabled-in-all-blocks true ;display logbook in all blocks after timetracking ;; :enabled-in-timestamped-blocks false ;don't display logbook at all ;; }
;; Mobile photo uploading setup ;; :mobile/photo ;; 手机照片上传设置 ;; :手机/照片 ;; {:allow-editing? true}
;; Mobile features options ;; Gestures ;; :mobile ;; {:gestures/disabled-in-block-with-tags ["kanban"]}
;; Extra CodeMirror options ;; :editor/extra-codemirror-options {:keyMap "emacs" :lineWrapping true}
;; ignore #+keyword: for parsing page references in orgmode ;; :ignored-page-references-keywords #{"author" "startup"}
;; Quick capture templates on mobile for recieving contents from other apps. ;; Each template contains three elements {time}, {text} and {url}, which can be auto-expanded ;; by received contents from other apps. Note: the {} cannot be omitted. ;; - {time}: capture time ;; - {text}: text that users selected before sharing. ;; - {url}: url or assets path for media files stored in Logseq. ;; You can also reorder them, or even only use one or two of them in the template. ;; You can also insert or format any text in the template as shown in the following examples. ;; :quick-capture-templates ;; {:text "[[quick capture]] **{time}**: {text} from {url}" ;; :media "[[quick capture]] **{time}**: {url}"}
;; File sync options ;; Ignore these files when syncing, regexp is supported. ;; 文件同步选项 ;; 同步时忽略这些文件，支持正则表达式。 ;; :file-sync/ignore-files []
;; dwim（按我的意思做）用于编辑时的 Enter 键。 ;; Enter 键的上下文感知使编辑更容易 ; ：dwim/设置{ ; ：警告&src？真的 ; ：标记？错误的 ; ：块参考？真的 ; ：页面参考？真的 ; ：特性？真的 ; ：列表？错误的 ; } } ;; dwim (do what I mean) for Enter key when editing. ;; Context-awareness of Enter key makes editing more easily ; :dwim/settings { ; :admonition&src? true ; :markup? false ; :block-ref? true ; :page-ref? true ; :properties? true ; :list? false ; }
} ``` - # 插件推荐 - ![image.png](logseq_2026-03-08-23_0220776.png) - ![image.png](logseq_2026-03-08-23_0220866.png) - ![image.png](logseq_2026-03-08-23_0220946.png) 1. Text Wrapper - 鼠标选中时候弹出的工具栏，在Pc端很好用很方便。 2. Logseq AI Auto Tags - 群里大佬做的工具，可以一键给网页或者段落加上对应的标签。 3. Save Scrollbar Position - 保存页面的浏览进度，返回上一页的时候自动回到该进度。 4. Scroll past bottom - 让页面底部可以超出一半，方便打字。 5. JournaIs calendar - 日历。 6. Markdown TabIe Editor - 表格增强。 7. Сору Code - 可以一键复制代码。 8. Random Note - 随机页面。 9. Reminder - 调用系统提醒。 10. Link Preview - 鼠标落到链接上的时候可以预览网页情况。 11. Char Spacing - 中文英文之间加上空格，比如for example这样123哈哈。 12. Iogseq-pomodoro-plugin - 工具栏上加一个番茄钟。 ## 今日速记 - [ ] 17:38 你好 - [ ] 17:27 测试 - [ ] 17:24 独立页面的任务 - [ ] 17:23 很久之前的任务 - [x] 17:23 几年前的人物 ✅️ 2026-07-30 - [x] 17:21 男单独 - [x] 17:21 你好 - [x] 16:47 你好呀 - [ ] 14:30 你 - [ ] 14:30 ![[附件/2026-07-31_143050_qd_recording_3500939148347945763.m4a]] - [ ] 14:31 ![2026-07-31_143103_qd_camera_1631414649267679119](附件/2026-07-31_143103_qd_camera_1631414649267679119.jpg)
